Subject: [PATCH 3/6] UI-FLOWS-3: moving money out of Ready to Assign works
 again

Every move from Ready to Assign, the Move screen's default source and the
first suggestion under Cover, answered 404 "That envelope does not
exist.": 6efbf04 ran from_category_id through the envelope visibility
guard, and "rta" is not an envelope. It is now let through; the
destination is still checked.

